<div class="
  bg-subtle border border-secondary rounded-lg shadow-sm
  hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200
  {{ class }}
">
  {{ content }}
</div>
```

### 2. Navigation Items
```liquid
<a class="
  block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium
  text-secondary hover:text-primary hover:bg-emphasis
